    "Identifies weaker opponents and attacks the limitations in their play.":{"ms":"Mengenal pasti lawan lemah dan menyerang batas permainan mereka.","ja":"弱い相手を特定し、そのプレーの限界を狙う。"},
    "If you believe content should be reviewed or removed, raise a concern through the":{"ms":"Jika anda percaya kandungan perlu disemak atau dibuang, kemukakan kebimbangan melalui","ja":"内容の確認や削除が必要と思われる場合は、こちらからご連絡ください："},
    "In Chemistry, select Player A and Player B to evaluate any pair. Registered pair relationships and team-history baselines are clearly labelled.":{"ms":"Dalam Kimia, pilih Pemain A dan Pemain B untuk menilai mana-mana pasangan. Hubungan pasangan berdaftar dan skor asas sejarah pasukan dilabel dengan jelas.","ja":"相性画面で選手A・Bを選ぶと、どのペアでも評価できます。登録ペアとチーム経歴の基準値は区別して表示します。"},
    "Initiates England’s coordinated passing sequences and feeds runners in their attacking system.":{"ms":"Memulakan urutan hantaran England dan membekalkan pelari dalam sistem serangan.","ja":"Englandの連動パスを始め、システム内の走り手へ供給する。"},
    "Inspect pitch links for connected combinations. Select a deployed player and use Set Captain; the badge and Captain assignment are retained in your shared formation.":{"ms":"Semak hubungan padang untuk kombinasi terhubung. Pilih pemain ditempatkan dan gunakan Tetapkan Captain; lencana serta tugasan Captain dikekalkan dalam formasi dikongsi.","ja":"ピッチのリンクで連係を確認。配置済み選手を選び「キャプテン設定」を使うと、共有配置にもバッジと任命が保たれます。"},
    "Intellectual property & original work":{"ms":"Harta intelek & karya asal","ja":"知的財産と独自制作"},
    "Isagi helps Chigiri rediscover his ego, then later selects him specifically because Chigiri's speed can survive inside the Second Selection's devouring reactions.":{"ms":"Isagi membantu Chigiri menemui semula egonya, kemudian memilihnya kerana kelajuannya boleh bertahan dalam reaksi saling menelan Second Selection.","ja":"IsagiはChigiriのエゴ再発見を助け、Second Selectionの食らい合う反応を生き残れる速さを理由に選ぶ。"},
    "JAPAN U-20 WORLD CUP":{"ms":"WORLD CUP JEPUN U-20","ja":"日本U-20 WORLD CUP"},
    "Japan U-20: Sae immediately unlocked Shido's penalty-area instincts and supplied both of his goals.":{"ms":"Japan U-20: Sae terus membuka naluri kotak penalti Shido dan membekalkan kedua-dua golnya.","ja":"Japan U-20：SaeはShidoのボックス内の本能を引き出し、2得点とも供給した。"},
    "Japan defensive organizer":{"ms":"Penyusun pertahanan Japan","ja":"Japanの守備統率役"},
    "KICKOFF PUNISHMENT":{"ms":"HUKUMAN KICKOFF","ja":"キックオフの制裁"},
    "KING × HYENA":{"ms":"KING × HYENA","ja":"KING × ハイエナ"},
    "KNOW YOUR XI.":{"ms":"KENALI XI ANDA.","ja":"自分のXIを知ろう。"},
    "KNOWN NG11 THROUGH CH.364":{"ms":"NG11 DIKETAHUI HINGGA BAB 364","ja":"確認済みNG11：364話まで"},
    "Kaiser is the established ace of Noa's rational Bastard München structure, though Noa does not build every play around him.":{"ms":"Kaiser ialah ace utama struktur Bastard München rasional Noa, walaupun Noa tidak membina semua permainan di sekelilingnya.","ja":"KaiserはNoaの合理的なBastard München構造の既存エースだが、Noaが全プレーを彼中心に組むわけではない。"},
    "Keep your exact formation. Share your squad.":{"ms":"Kekalkan formasi tepat anda. Kongsi skuad.","ja":"作った配置をそのまま保ち、チームを共有。"},
    "Keeps chasing and contesting the ball through prolonged pressure in the Bird Cage challenge.":{"ms":"Terus mengejar dan merebut bola sepanjang tekanan Bird Cage.","ja":"Bird Cageの長いプレッシャーを通し、追いかけ争い続ける。"},
    "Keeps his centre of gravity stable through contact so opponents cannot easily knock him away from the ball.":{"ms":"Menstabilkan pusat graviti ketika kontak agar sukar dijatuhkan dari bola.","ja":"接触でも重心を安定させ、ボールから押し離されにくくする。"},
    "Keeps pace with fast opponents while advancing along France’s flank.":{"ms":"Mengimbangi lawan pantas sambil mara di sayap France.","ja":"速い相手についていきながらFranceのサイドを進む。"},
    "Keeps the ball secure while changing direction and selecting a shooting route.":{"ms":"Menjaga bola ketika menukar arah dan memilih laluan rembatan.","ja":"方向とシュートルートを選びながらボールを保持する。"},
    "Keeps touches ahead of his sprinting stride so he can carry the ball through a gap without surrendering his running advantage.":{"ms":"Menyentuh bola di hadapan langkah pecut untuk menembusi ruang tanpa kehilangan kelebihan kelajuan.","ja":"走る歩幅の前にボールを置き、速さを保って隙間を運ぶ。"},
    "Kept Auto Best evaluation aligned with the same Team OVR and Chemistry OVR formulas used by the visible UI.":{"ms":"Penilaian Auto Best diselaraskan dengan formula OVR Pasukan dan OVR Kimia yang digunakan UI.","ja":"Auto Bestを、画面に表示するチームOVR・相性OVRと同じ式で評価。"},
    "Kurona plays in Rin's Team A structure and is credited with assisting Rin's winning goal against Team C.":{"ms":"Kurona bermain dalam struktur Team A Rin dan dicatat membantu gol kemenangan Rin menentang Team C.","ja":"KuronaはRinのTeam Aでプレーし、Team C戦のRinの決勝弾をアシストしたと記録される。"},
