    "OVR, attributes and S–G grades are fan-made gameplay ratings. Primary and secondary badges show project-compatible roles. Demonstrated canon roles are recorded separately in dossiers. Chemistry interprets recorded relationships; it is not an official Blue Lock statistic.":{"ms":"OVR, atribut dan gred S–G ialah rating permainan peminat. Lencana menunjukkan peranan serasi projek. Posisi kanon direkodkan berasingan. Kimia mentafsir hubungan, bukan statistik rasmi.","ja":"OVR、能力、S–Gランクはファン制作の評価。バッジはゲーム内の適合役割で、原作の位置は別記。相性は関係の解釈で公式統計ではありません。"},
    "OVR, attributes, S–G grades and chemistry scores are fan-made gameplay ratings, not official Blue Lock statistics. Position badges show project-compatible roles; dossiers list demonstrated canon roles separately where recorded. Chemistry interprets existing relationships and shared team history. Profiles are a partial reference through the supported chapter, and quotes appear only with verified manga/anime source records.":{"ms":"OVR, atribut, gred S–G dan kimia ialah rating permainan peminat, bukan statistik rasmi Blue Lock. Lencana menunjukkan peranan projek; posisi kanon berasingan. Kimia mentafsir hubungan dan sejarah pasukan. Profil rujukan separa hingga bab disokong; petikan hanya dengan sumber manga/anime disahkan.","ja":"OVR、能力、S–G、相性はファン制作の評価。ゲーム上の位置と原作での位置は区別し、相性は関係と経歴を解釈します。紹介は対応話数までの一部で、引用は確認済みの原作・アニメ出典がある場合のみ表示します。"},
    "Observes player movement and passing lanes to anticipate developing attacks.":{"ms":"Memerhati pergerakan dan laluan hantaran untuk menjangka serangan.","ja":"動きとパスコースから次の攻撃を予測する。"},
    "Offence High → Low":{"ms":"Serangan Tinggi → Rendah","ja":"攻撃力 高い → 低い"},
    "Older milestones are summarized from repository snapshots and existing notes. Exact release dates and undocumented changes are intentionally omitted.":{"ms":"Pencapaian lama diringkaskan daripada snapshot dan nota repositori. Tarikh tepat dan perubahan tidak didokumenkan sengaja tidak dimasukkan.","ja":"過去の節目はリポジトリの記録から要約し、正確な日付や未記録の変更は省略しています。"},
    "One half of the Wanima partnership, a forward who thrives on synchronized movement and familiar combination play built through years beside his brother.":{"ms":"Separuh gandingan Wanima, pakar pergerakan selaras dan kombinasi hasil bertahun-tahun bersama saudaranya.","ja":"兄弟と長年培った同期した動きと連係を得意とする、Wanimaペアの一人。"},
    "One half of the Wanima partnership, relying on coordinated timing, shared reads and rehearsed attacking movement with his brother. After his First Selection elimination, he later enters Side-B.":{"ms":"Separuh gandingan Wanima, menggunakan timing selaras dan pergerakan terlatih bersama saudaranya. Selepas tersingkir First Selection, dia memasuki Side-B.","ja":"兄弟との同期したタイミング、共通の読み、練習した攻撃の動きを使うWanimaペアの一人。First Selection脱落後、Side-Bへ参加。"},
