    "PXG MIDFIELD":{"ms":"TENGAH PXG","ja":"PXGの中盤"},
    "PXG: Charles' contrarian passing repeatedly targets Shido's extreme penalty-area movement.":{"ms":"PXG: hantaran Charles sering menyasarkan pergerakan ekstrem Shido dalam kotak penalti.","ja":"PXG：Charlesの天邪鬼なパスは、Shidoの極端なボックス内の動きを狙う。"},
    "PXG: Kiyora's extreme-backspin pass stopped perfectly for Kaiser's Magnus, directly creating Kaiser's goal.":{"ms":"PXG: backspin ekstrem Kiyora berhenti sempurna untuk Magnus Kaiser dan mencipta golnya.","ja":"PXG：Kiyoraの強烈なバックスピンパスがKaiserのMagnusに完璧に止まり、得点を生む。"},
    "PXG: after prolonged conflict, Kaiser reset his ego and partnered with Isagi to break the genius-led defense.":{"ms":"PXG: selepas konflik panjang, Kaiser mengubah egonya dan bergandingan dengan Isagi untuk memecahkan pertahanan genius.","ja":"PXG：長い対立後、Kaiserはエゴを組み直し、Isagiと天才主導の守備を崩した。"},
    "Pablo is the team's central passing facilitator while Loki covers both attack and defense, making them naturally compatible inside the World Five optimal-position system.":{"ms":"Pablo mengurus hantaran pusat, Loki meliputi serangan dan pertahanan; serasi dalam sistem posisi optimum World Five.","ja":"Pabloが配球の中心、Lokiが攻守を広く担い、World Fiveの最適位置システムでかみ合う。"},
    "Pablo repeatedly facilitates the World Five passing chain and directly routes possession toward Blake in their professional attack.":{"ms":"Pablo melancarkan rantaian hantaran World Five dan menghantar kepada Blake dalam serangan profesional.","ja":"PabloはWorld Fiveのパス連鎖を進め、プロの攻撃でBlakeへつなぐ。"},
    "Pablo threads/crosses through pressure to Dada, whose aerial presence turns the delivery into the next scoring action.":{"ms":"Pablo menghantar melalui tekanan kepada Dada, yang menjadikan bola itu peluang gol melalui keupayaan udara.","ja":"Pabloがプレッシャーを越えてDadaへ供給し、空中での存在感が次の得点動作につながる。"},
    "Page Not Found":{"ms":"Halaman Tidak Ditemui","ja":"ページが見つかりません"},
    "Passing High → Low":{"ms":"Hantaran Tinggi → Rendah","ja":"パス 高い → 低い"},
    "Pick a formation, then drag players into slots or onto Reserves.":{"ms":"Pilih formasi, kemudian seret pemain ke slot atau Simpanan.","ja":"配置を選び、選手を枠または控えへドラッグ。"},
    "Places curved strikes into narrow goal openings, making his own finishing a threat alongside his passing.":{"ms":"Meletakkan rembatan melengkung ke bukaan sempit, mengancam gol selain mencipta hantaran.","ja":"狭いゴールの隙間へ曲がる球を置き、パスに加え得点でも脅かす。"},
    "Places passes and kicks precisely to connect teammates over difficult distances.":{"ms":"Meletakkan hantaran dan tendangan tepat untuk jarak sukar.","ja":"難しい距離でもパスとキックを正確に置く。"},
