    "Player OVR, attributes, S–G grades and chemistry scores are fan-made gameplay values. Project-compatible positions and tactical interpretations are distinguished from demonstrated canon-role references in dossiers. Character profiles retain the project’s recorded reference information; a missing role or quote is valid. They are not official Blue Lock statistics, canon rankings or statements by the original creators.":{"ms":"OVR, atribut, gred S–G dan kimia ialah nilai permainan peminat. Posisi projek dan tafsiran taktikal berbeza daripada peranan kanon. Profil mengekalkan rujukan projek; ketiadaan peranan atau petikan sah. Ini bukan statistik rasmi, ranking kanon atau kenyataan pencipta asal.","ja":"OVR、能力、S–G、相性はファン制作のゲーム値。適合位置や戦術解釈は原作の役割と区別します。紹介は本プロジェクトの記録で、役割や引用がない状態も有効です。公式統計、原作順位、作者の声明ではありません。"},
    "Player chemistry links":{"ms":"Hubungan kimia pemain","ja":"選手の相性リンク"},
    "Player identity":{"ms":"Identiti pemain","ja":"選手の人物情報"},
    "Player intelligence Database: role, grade, category and history filters, attribute sorting, compact cards and three-player comparison.":{"ms":"Pangkalan Data: penapis peranan, gred, kategori dan sejarah, susunan atribut, kad kompak dan perbandingan tiga pemain.","ja":"データベース：役割・ランク・区分・経歴フィルター、能力順、コンパクトなカード、3人比較。"},
    "Player-by-player football-weapon audit with concise descriptions and internal source records, preserving existing Isagi entries.":{"ms":"Audit senjata setiap pemain dengan penerangan ringkas dan sumber dalaman, mengekalkan entri Isagi.","ja":"各選手の武器を確認し、簡潔な説明と内部出典を追加。既存Isagi記録を維持。"},
    "Please enter a valid bid.":{"ms":"Masukkan bidaan sah.","ja":"有効な入札額を入力してください。"},
    "Please enter names for both teams.":{"ms":"Masukkan nama kedua-dua pasukan.","ja":"両チームの名前を入力してください。"},
    "Position":{"ms":"Posisi","ja":"ポジション"},
    "Positions his body to draw contact and earn fouls from opponents.":{"ms":"Memposisikan tubuh untuk menarik kontak dan mendapatkan foul.","ja":"身体を置いて接触を誘い、ファウルを得る。"},
    "Preferences:":{"ms":"Pilihan:","ja":"設定："},
    "Presentation-only tactical pitch spacing fix across all formations; clearer Light Mode reference views.":{"ms":"Pembaikan jarak paparan taktikal semua formasi dan rujukan Mod Cerah lebih jelas.","ja":"全配置の見た目の間隔とライトモードの参照表示を改善。"},
    "Presets only change budget, bid interval and roster size. Team names, colors and player pool stay yours.":{"ms":"Pratetap hanya menukar bajet, sela bidaan dan saiz skuad. Nama, warna dan kumpulan pemain kekal.","ja":"プリセットは予算、刻み幅、人数だけ変更。名前、色、選手プールは維持。"},
    "Previous feature preview":{"ms":"Pratonton ciri sebelumnya","ja":"前の機能プレビュー"},
    "Primary":{"ms":"Utama","ja":"メイン"},
    "Primary and secondary badges are project gameplay roles. Demonstrated canon positions appear separately where recorded. OVR and radar attributes use the shared S–G grade scale: S 90–100, A 80–89, B 70–79, C 60–69, D 50–59, E 40–49, F 30–39, G 0–29.":{"ms":"Lencana utama/sekunder ialah peranan permainan projek. Posisi kanon berasingan. OVR dan radar menggunakan gred S–G: S 90–100, A 80–89, B 70–79, C 60–69, D 50–59, E 40–49, F 30–39, G 0–29.","ja":"主・副バッジはゲーム上の役割で、原作位置は別記。OVRとレーダーの共通評価：S 90–100、A 80–89、B 70–79、C 60–69、D 50–59、E 40–49、F 30–39、G 0–29。"},
